text I am walking in the hallway after second period.
text Strolling past all the other classrooms, I am on my way to the restroom.
text @[Tomoya]
text ...?
text I feel pretty bothered by all people staring at me.
text I get the feeling that lots of people are trying to get a glimpse of me through the windows.
text It's true that I am rarely here this early...
text But, no, I've been getting here during the morning lately.
text It really bugs me...
text After taking care of my business in the restroom, I can still feel everyone looking at me on my way back to the classroom.
text It feels as if people are talking behind my back.
text When I take a closer look, I notice it is both boys and girls staring at me.
text @[Tomoya]
text Hm?
text Then, when I look in front of me, I see Kyou by chance.
text Right as she's heading into her classroom.
text @[Tomoya]
text Yo.
